\par\par \b \uc2 MARKET TALK:  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Has Kept Up  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 139 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Juni 2011\par 19:08\par \uc2 Dow Jones News Service\par \uc2 DJ\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 1:08 (Dow Jones) \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has changed its strategy for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, but there hasn't been much of a change in the overall size of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , says Merrill. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  halted forward auctions in April and May, and cut the amount of reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap auctions. That alone "would indicate that there was a significant decline in the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  effort in May," it says. But emphasis seems to have switched to the spot market. "Despite the change in the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy, there is no clear change in the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, as total inflows also declined at the margin. (matthew.cowley@dowjones.com)\par \par \uc2 Call us at (212) 416-2184 or email paul.vigna@dowjones.com [ 06-08-11 1308ET ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJ00000020110608e768000el\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
