\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  steps up  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2  with forwards\b0\par\par\uc2 247 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 Januar 2011\par 00:10\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  cenbank to offer \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  forwards for first time\par \par \uc2 * Forward auctions add to moves to curb real's rally\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, Jan 25 (Reuters) - Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Tuesday it could offer \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  forwards in market auctions for the first time ever, adding to several moves in recent weeks to help curb a rally in the national \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The bank said only financial firms already registered as dealers in its electronic system may participate in the auctions.\par \par \uc2 Just like its regular \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  auctions in the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the bank will call the forward auctions and will unveil terms of the transactions, with the key difference that contracts are settled at a future date.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the real <BRBY>, firmed 4.6 percent last year against the dollar, following gains of 34 percent in 2009, raising concerns among executives and government officials about the effects on local exporters and a flood of cheap imports into the country.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  began selling reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps on Jan. 14 for the first time since May 2009. The swaps, a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  derivative that effectively allows the bank to buy U.S. dollars on the futures market, came 