\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  cenbank sets  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  move as real firms\b0\par\par\uc2 771 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 2011\par 21:08\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to hold reverse swap auction\par \par \uc2 * Auction could be worth up to $1 billion\par \par \uc2 * Strength of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is worry for government (Recasts with bank decision, details)\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO, Jan 13 (Reuters) - Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it will launch a new \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  measure on Friday, which could help curb the surging real and protect exports as developed and emerging economies lock horns over imbalances in trade and growth.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday said it would sell up to $1 billion of reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps, a derivative that effectively allows the bank to buy U.S. dollars on the futures market, which could in turn help weaken the real <BRBY>.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not deployed the derivatives since May 2009, and economists saw the move as squarely aimed at curbing gains in the real, which firmed 4.6 percent against the dollar last year after gaining 34 percent in 2009.\par \par \uc2 "They're adopting erratic measures, with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rules that are hardly clear," said Roberto Padovani, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2  economist at WestLB. "The policy goal is to increase the uncertainty for those who trade in the Brazilian market."\par \par \uc2 Emerging markets around the world have seen their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  surge, as their economic growth outpaces that of a number of still-struggling developed nations. Low interest rates in developed countries designed to spur economic growth -- most notably the United States and the 17-member euro zone -- have spurred huge inflows of capitals to countries like \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The trend has led to a wave of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  around the world. Chile's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , for example, this month said it would buy $12 billion to try to tame the peso.\par \par \uc2 In Brazil the measures have ranged from daily auctions to buy dollars on the spot market to a reserve requirement, announced last week, on banks' short U.S. dollar positions.\par \par \uc2 The reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap to be launched in Brazil on Friday will be sold over as many as 20,000 contracts. They will include expirations in April and July 2011 and January 2012.\par \par \uc2 The auction will run from 12 p.m. to 12:30 p.m. local time (1400 to 1430 GMT), with the results announced after 12:45 p.m. (1445 GMT). For a factbox, see [ID:nN13101362].\par \par \uc2 But analysts say few government measures, if any, have had a long-term effect in Brazil.\par \par \uc2 The country's continued strong economy -- coupled with some of the world's highest interest rates -- has drawn money borrowed at near zero-rates abroad into Brazilian assets.\par \par \uc2 And the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , confronted with a consumer inflation rate that jumped to 5.91 percent in 2010, is expected to raise its benchmark lending rate to 11.25 percent from 10.75 percent at a meeting next Wednesday, which would likely put even more upward pressure on the real. [ID:nSPG003198]\par \par \uc2 "While more measures cannot be ruled out going ahead, one concern is that more dramatic steps ahead might lead observers to start wondering whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime can still be described as a truly floating exchange rate regime," \uc2 BNP Paribas\uc2  economist Marcelo Carvalho wrote to clients.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's finance minister has termed the global tensions an "international \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  war," with countries such as the United States and China facing pressure to allow their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to strengthen further.\par \par \uc2 When used regularly for an extended period, reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps are considered a tool of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In the current context, they would be used to prevent the real from strengthening too much.\par \par \uc2 Under the agreement, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  agrees to pay investors Brazil's local interbank rate in exchange for a rate in U.S. dollars for the duration of the contract.\par \par \uc2 The difference between the two rates is calculated and paid out on a daily basis for the duration of the contract.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  first started offering reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps in February 2005, used them regularly until September 2008, and then once more on May 5, 2009.\par \par \uc2 Reverse \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps have been used on a one-off basis by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth out distortions in Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, closing off arbitrage opportunities.\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian real was bid 0.48 percent stronger at 1.667 reais per U.S. dollar on the local spot market on Thursday. (Reporting by Silvio Cascione, Jose de Castro and Samantha Pearson in Sao Paulo and Ana Nicolaci da Costa in Brasilia; Writing by Luciana Lopez; Editing by Leslie Adler)\par \par \uc2 BRAZIL-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /REVERSESWAP (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|ABN|D|E|RBN|M|U|C|GRO|MTL|SOF|RNP|DNP|PCM   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110113e71d001mp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
