\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS-Brazil's real dips, US earnings lift peso\b0\par\par\uc2 562 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Januar 2011\par 13:56\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real dips 0.1 pct as \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  fears weigh\par \par \uc2 * Mexican peso gains 0.3 pct, Chilean peso up 0.4 pct (Adds comments, updates prices, changes byline)\par \par \uc2 By Samantha Pearson and Michael O'Boyle\par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO/MEXICO CITY, Jan 11 (Reuters) - Brazil's real underperformed Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday as concerns over official meddling in the market kept investors nervous.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Chilean and Mexican pesos edged higher, buoyed by hopes for a solid U.S. earnings season. However, lingering concerns over euro zone debt limited gains. For details, see [ID:nLDE70A0GC]\par \par \uc2 The threat of more aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the Brazilian market weighed on the real <BRBY>, which was 0.12 percent weaker at 1.688 reais per U.S. dollar on the local spot market.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's finance minister, Guido Mantega, said Monday he was sure the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not strengthen further, adding that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  via so-called reverse swaps in the futures market would carry little financial risk. [ID:nN10282474]\par \par \uc2 If reverse swaps are used, the real could weaken to 1.75-1.77 per dollar, according to one New York-based head \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader.\par \par \uc2 The government has taken a number of measures to try to put the brakes on the real's recent gains, including a new reserve requirement on banks' short U.S. dollar positions.\par \par \uc2 "Mantega's threats went largely ignored by the market, though he is making it quite clear that policymakers will fight very hard against any further BRL appreciation," said Nick Chamie of RBC in a research note.\par \par \uc2 EURO ZONE LIMITS GAINS\par \par \uc2 The Mexican \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  <MXN=> strengthened 0.28 percent to 12.179 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Surprisingly strong U.S. earnings could further back bets that robust growth in the United States will feed into Mexico's closely linked economy and support further gains for the peso.\par \par \uc2 Renewed fears over a spreading euro zone debt crisis have haunted global markets over the past couple of days, keeping investors on the sidelines.\par \par \uc2 "I am a little nervous on (emerging markets). It has decoupled so far, but we have seen minor stuff so far," said Win Thin, an emerging markets strategist at \uc2 Brown Brothers Harriman\uc2  in New York.\par \par \uc2 "We have been talking small potatoes with Greece, Ireland and Portugal. If this contagion continues, and you get Spain and it starts to spread to Italy and France, you are talking some pretty serious stuff," he said.\par \par \uc2 "I am more and more negative that things are heading that way."\par \par \uc2 The Chilean peso <CLP=> firmed 0.44 percent to 496.3 per dollar, helped by higher prices for copper, the country's main export.\par \par \uc2 "The peso's performance here is mainly following what is going on abroad," said Rodrigo Sarria, a trader at Celfin Capital in Santiago.\par \par \uc2 "We have copper going up, so we should see the market here trying to test new levels. We could see corrections between 15 and 18 pesos in the next few days, which would be half of how much the peso fell following \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he added.\par \par \uc2 Chile's peso slumped last week after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced a massive dollar-buying plan to curb its strength. (Additional reporting by Maria Jose Latorre in Santiago; editing by Jeffrey Benkoe)\par \par \uc2 MARKETS-LATAM/\b \highlight22\uc2 FOREX\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|D|M   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110114e71b000wl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
